# Project TITAN MASTER POLICY V1.0

**Official Development Rule**

Project TITAN is not "building a program" — it is building a **QMS the company actually uses**.

**Completion criterion:** *"Can the company use this tomorrow?"*

---

## 1. Development Principle

**개발 = Demo 구축**

Simultaneous and all required for **done**:

- 기능 구현 · Demo 데이터 · Workflow 연결 · 출력물 · **Beta 시연**

---

## 2. Development Flow

```text
Local Host (vite --host) → develop → test → Build
→ Git Commit → Git Push → Beta → meeting → feedback → fix
```

---

## 3. Environments

| Env | Use |
|-----|-----|
| **Local Host** | Development |
| **Beta** (`ndk-qms-beta.vercel.app`) | Meeting · demo · review |
| **Release** | Electron EXE + SQLite — production |

---

## 4. Git Branches

- `main` — Release
- `beta-demo` — Meeting · Vercel
- `develop` — Optional dev

---

## 5. Demo Policy

**No Dummy Data.** Real: 거래처 · 품번 · 품명 · 재질 · 단가 · Workflow.

**Primary demo company:** **서암기계공업**

---

## 6. UI Policy (Freeze)

Foundation UI · Desktop ERP layout · **No responsive/mobile** · min-width · horizontal scroll OK

---

## 7. Workflow (Fixed)

```text
입고등록 → 열처리 작업 요청 리스트 → 생산일보 → 검사등록 → 성적서
→ 출고등록 → 거래명세서 → 이력조회
```

---

## 8. Sprint Model (Business units — not pages)

| Sprint | Scope |
|--------|--------|
| **Sprint 3** | 입고 → 열처리 작업 요청 리스트 |
| Sprint 4 | 생산일보 |
| Sprint 5 | 검사 · 성적서 |
| Sprint 6 | 출고 · 거래명세서 |
| Sprint 7 | SQLite |
| Sprint 8 | Electron EXE |

One Sprint = one real business flow **complete**.

---

## 9. Print Output Policy

Shared: Header · Footer · document numbers · PDF · design · QR.

**Order:** HTML Preview → **PM approval** → PDF → Workflow → Beta

**Before PM approval:** no PDF finalize, Commit, Push, or Beta deploy for that output.

---

## 10. Documents (DOC)

| ID | Name | Number |
|----|------|--------|
| DOC-01 | 열처리 작업 요청 리스트 | `HTL-YYYYMMDD-001` |
| DOC-02 | 생산일보 | `DPR-YYYYMMDD-001` |
| DOC-03 | 검사성적서 | `COA-YYYYMMDD-001` |
| DOC-04 | 거래명세서 | `INV-YYYYMMDD-001` |

---

## 11. QR Policy (Default)

All **internal** prints include QR. **Exception:** 거래명세서 — supplier QR only.

**Payload:** 문서번호 · 관리번호 · 업체명 · 품번 · LOT · 문서종류 · 버전

**Roadmap:** V1.0 QR print → V1.1 scan/open → V2.0 Smart QR · labels · status colors

---

## 12–15. Future Roadmap (Reference)

- **Mobile Mode:** QR scan → role-specific mobile screens (post V1.0 desktop)
- **AI V2.1:** Natural query · anomaly search
- **Smart Factory V3.0:** MES · ERP · IoT · realtime dashboard

Do not implement roadmap items unless explicitly requested.

---

## 16. Completion Checklist (Every task)

□ 기능 · □ Demo · □ Workflow · □ 출력물 · □ Build · □ Console 0 · □ React 0 · □ Commit · □ Push · □ Beta · □ **PM 승인**

---

## 17. Ultimate Goal

Unified QMS platform: 입고 · 생산 · 검사 · 성적서 · 출고 · LOT · QR · documents · (future) mobile · AI · MES · ERP — one connected system.

**Priority:** real operational use over UI or feature count.
